g></button></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:items-start gap-6 mb-10\"><div class=\"relative w-24 h-24 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-[var(--color-muted)]\"><img alt=\"Robert Hayes\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A254a93ab7be64c29a8f25fe79ab3ad43B.jpg\"/></div><div><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-2\">Robert Hayes</h1><p class=\"text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] max-w-xl\">Outdoor power equipment specialist and certified small-engine technician with 24 years of hands-on industry experience. Former lead product tester for Consumer Reports lawn and garden equipment division, evaluating over 500 mowers, trimmers, and blowers across 15 testing seasons. Holds ASE certification in small-engine repair and has consulted for major manufacturers including John Deere, Toro, and Husqvarna on product development. Published equipment reviewer for This Old House, Popular Mechanics, and Fine Gardening magazines.</p></div></div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-6\">Articles by <!-- -->Robert Hayes</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/best-grass-seed-for-ct-sun-and-shade\"><img alt=\"Best Grass Seed for CT: Top Picks for Sun &amp; Shade\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Ad945a96cb83944568e70ad6b2ba16182B.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/grass-types\">Grass Types</a><a href=\"/blog/best-grass-seed-for-ct-sun-and-shade\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">Best Grass Seed for CT: Top Picks for Sun &amp; Shade</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Discover the best grass seed for Connecticut lawns in both sun and shade. Expert picks, growing tips, and maintenance advice for a lush CT lawn.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Robert Hayes</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-29 00:26:57\">Aug 29, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/preventing-treating-cypress-tip-moth-damage-arborvitae-hedges\"><img alt=\"Preventing &amp; Treating Cypress Tip Moth Damage on Arborvitae Hedges\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A8418fec226bb409a9c1448f097d66466U.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/pest-control\">Pest Control</a><a href=\"/blog/preventing-treating-cypress-tip-moth-damage-arborvitae-hedges\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">Preventi